@startuml
title Relational Access Component - L0 Overall Boundary

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 60

package "Business / Template Layer" {
  [Business Template\nOrder / Payment / Clearing] as Business
  [Business Repository Port] as BizRepo
  [MyBatis / JPA / jOOQ Adapter] as ORM
}

package "High-level Technical Component APIs\n[Business Template depends here]" {
  [Idempotency API\nIdempotencyExecutor] as IdemApi
  [Message API\nMessageTemplate] as MsgApi
  [Retry API\nRetryExecutor] as RetryApi
  [Transaction API\nTransactionTemplate] as TxApi
}

package "Technical Component Storage Adapters\n[Component implementation depends on relational-api]" {
  [JdbcIdempotencyStorage] as IdemStorage
  [JdbcOutboxStorage] as OutboxStorage
  [JdbcTaskStorage] as TaskStorage
}

package "Relational Access Component" {
  [relational-api\nRelationalTemplate\nSqlStatement / RowMapper] as RAApi
  [relational-spi\nConnectionProvider\nDataSourceResolver\nExceptionTranslator] as RASpi
  [relational-core\nFUTURE] as RACore
  [transaction / sharding / observation\nintegrations - FUTURE] as Integrations
}

package "Business Persistence Framework" {
  [MyBatis / JPA / jOOQ] as BizPersistence
}

database "DataSource / JDBC" as DS
database "Relational Database" as DB

Business --> IdemApi : high-level capability
Business --> MsgApi : high-level capability
Business --> RetryApi : high-level capability
Business --> TxApi : high-level capability
Business --> BizRepo : business persistence port

BizRepo --> ORM
ORM --> BizPersistence
BizPersistence --> DS

IdemApi --> IdemStorage : storage port implementation
MsgApi --> OutboxStorage : optional outbox
IdemStorage --> RAApi
OutboxStorage --> RAApi
TaskStorage --> RAApi

RAApi --> RACore : implemented by (future)
RACore --> RASpi : extension contracts
Integrations --> RASpi
Integrations ..> TxApi : transaction bridge
RACore --> DS
DS --> DB

note top of Business
Business Template should stay farther away from JDBC.
It normally sees high-level component APIs and its own Repository ports.
end note

note bottom of IdemStorage
Storage Adapter owns domain-storage translation:
tryAcquire -> SQL + parameters + route + result interpretation.
end note

note bottom of RAApi
Relational Access does NOT understand
idempotency / order / outbox semantics.
It executes an already determined relational operation.
end note

@enduml
